# {ProjectName} Runtime-R4L

{Description}

This library is an independent unit. Its contract, baseline, implementation,
Zig, C and Rust consumer bindings, conformance fixtures, and tests remain together.
module.R4MF is the build and image source of truth.

Build and test:

    zig build test

Intentionally evolve the contract:

    R4LContractGen --write --update-baseline

Supply the paths defined by module.R4MF. Normal builds only verify materialized
contract files and never rewrite sources.
The BINDING_RUST output is generated from the same local contract. Its
Bindings/Rust/Cargo.toml owns the independent consumer crate version; the
provider implementation stays Zig. Rust consumers select that path crate
and the matched r4os-sdk explicitly in their own Cargo project.
